-- rules/policies/evidence.rofl — evidence quality policy: staleness.
-- Evidence pinned to a version stops supporting anything once the current
-- version moves on (roadmap §20: evidence must not inherit freshness
-- implicitly; Phase 3 test: stale tests do not support the current
-- deployment).
--
-- EDB:
--   evidence_version[obs](E, Version)   -- what the evidence was taken on
--   current_version(Version)            -- what is deployed now
--
-- Without this file loaded (or without version facts) nothing is ever
-- stale — epistemic.rofl's `not stale_evidence` premise fails finitely,
-- which the kernel handles (test/kernel-edge.test.ts).

stale_evidence[epistemic](E) :- evidence_version[obs](E, V),
                                current_version(V2),
                                V != V2.
